{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/multaqua-avenue-dubai-investments-mirdif","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":645,"crm_id":"651","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Multaqua Avenue","slug":"multaqua-avenue-dubai-investments-mirdif","display_address":"Mirdif","building_type":["commerce","apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Dubai Investments","price":1350000,"display_price":"1.35M","lattitude":25.2232335,"longitude":55.4227837,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Al Multaqa Avenue is a commercial center in Mirdif Hills by developer Dubai Investmens, which includes Mirdif's first hotel. The four-star hotel comprises 116 rooms and 132 serviced apartments, including 300 studios and <strong>1 and 2-bedroom apartments.</strong> There is more than 130,000 square feet of retail space with restaurants, cafes, stores and boutiques, as well as more than 60,000 square feet of office space.</p><p>The main feature of the complex is its stunning architecture, stylish finishes with high quality materials and world-class amenities. The complex also features 24-hour security with video surveillance and a large parking lot.</p><p>Mirdif Hills is characterized by functionality through a superb selection of purpose-built premium retail units. Restaurants, cafes and inspiring leisure and entertainment options are within walking distance.</p><p>Dubai Festival City and Dubai International Airport are just 15 minutes away, while Dubai International Financial Centre, Dubai Internet City and Dubai Mall are within 20-30 minutes.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/651/images/2024/01/06/gV2jLmExR4T0cXMCNK8HfdihmRQbITH1wjCfIyXQ.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/0